\tag{fnip}
\title{The threshold}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{A step and a slow ramp can end at the same current and
still disagree about whether the cell fires. The threshold
is not a voltage of the membrane.}

\p{What does the current do to the state, and which states
fire?}

